  "crossSystemAcceptanceProposals": [
    "A committed conception survives save/reload with identical parents, offspring genome and appearance seed.",
    "Opening a forecast or changing cosmetics does not advance the authoritative breeding RNG stream.",
    "Actual parent genotype and player knowledge are distinct; a knowledge-limited forecast cannot read hidden genotype through an unintended code path.",
    "A hypothetical scenario cannot be committed as if its assumed alleles were actual parent alleles.",
    "Gray changes the supported appearance with visualAge but never the underlying base genotype.",
    "Supported classic-roan homozygotes are not classified as lethal.",
    "Marketplace ownership changes preserve horseId, parents, genotype, resolverVersion and conception history.",
    "Genetic marker effect sizes for aptitude are labeled fictional game data; generation number and color rarity add no performance bonus."
  ],
